d 'PPPLOT': module for P-P plots
d
d  ppplot produces a P-P (probability-probability) plot  of the
d cumulative distribution functions of one or  more groups or
d variables against that of a reference  group or variable, for the
d same sets of observed values.  By default the reference group is
d the last variable named,  or, with a single variable, that
d defined by the highest value	of the grouping variable. 
d
d KW: graphics
d KW: probability-probability plot
d KW: P-P plot 
d
d Requires: Stata version 8.0
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260825
d
d Author: Nicholas J. Cox, Durham University
d Support: email N.J.Cox@@durham.ac.uk
d
f ppplot.ado
f ppplot.sthlp
f ppplot_examples.do
